00:12:37.036 --> 00:12:39.782
I've consistently been a
where-there's-smoke-there's-fire

00:12:39.782 --> 00:12:42.458
kind of guy, and I don't
mean shut down from social,

00:12:42.458 --> 00:12:45.603
weird stuff, I mean just, move the family

00:12:45.603 --> 00:12:48.576
to Sydney Australia, let
the kids spend a year there

00:12:48.576 --> 00:12:52.035
and just zen it out, get real real buff.

00:12:52.035 --> 00:12:55.100
And I want to stretch more.

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:58.033
Anyway, official Jets prediction.

00:12:58.033 --> 00:13:00.301
The New York Jets are very hurt.

00:13:00.301 --> 00:13:02.216
We're on our fourth safety.

00:13:02.216 --> 00:13:04.039
Fourth safety.

00:13:04.039 --> 00:13:05.861
The Buffalo Bills are getting healthy.

00:13:05.861 --> 00:13:08.578
The Jets won by five
points against a Jags team

00:13:08.578 --> 00:13:11.121
that hadn't won a road game in 12 games

00:13:11.121 --> 00:13:13.965
after they won the turnover
battle four to zero,

00:13:13.965 --> 00:13:16.913
four to zero, they won by five points.

00:13:16.913 --> 00:13:19.177
I think Buffalo is getting healthier,

00:13:19.177 --> 00:13:21.278
I think we're extremely banged up.

00:13:21.278 --> 00:13:24.053
We lost one of our guards for the year,

00:13:24.053 --> 00:13:26.862
our center Nick Mangold is banged up,

00:13:26.862 --> 00:13:28.918
all of our receivers are banged up,

00:13:28.918 --> 00:13:30.820
our quarterback's thumb is banged up.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:34.338
We are one banged up, banged up team.

00:13:34.338 --> 00:13:37.101
I see disaster for my
New York Jets tonight.

00:13:37.101 --> 00:13:39.377
It crushes me to say this,

00:13:39.377 --> 00:13:41.500
but I think we get pretty handled.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:44.496
I think we get blown out,
I actually really do,

00:13:44.496 --> 00:13:47.375
which just sucks, but
I think the Jets lose

00:13:47.375 --> 00:13:51.159
tonight 29 to 10.

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:59.856
Question of the day, 'cause
I'm bringing that back.

00:13:59.856 --> 00:14:02.133
Question of the day:

00:14:04.643 --> 00:14:06.253
since that really just hurt my feelings

00:14:06.253 --> 00:14:08.399
what's the last thing
that you've had to say

00:14:08.399 --> 00:14:11.476
out loud that really disappointed you?

00:14:11.476 --> 00:14:15.516
You keep asking questions,
I'll keep answering them.

00:14:15.516 --> 00:14:17.628
Actually you know what, I'm
gonna fix my prediction.

00:14:17.628 --> 00:14:19.034
I just thought about it a little bit more,

00:14:19.034 --> 00:14:21.391
I think the Jets are gonna score
a little more than I think.

00:14:21.391 --> 00:14:23.828
I'm changing it, first
time, first time change.

00:14:23.828 --> 00:14:28.227
I'm going 31 16 Buffalo.

00:14:30.417 --> 00:14:31.652
Thanks brother.

00:14:31.652 --> 00:14:33.255
What's that?

00:14:33.255 --> 00:14:35.135
Thank you.

00:14:35.135 --> 00:14:36.214
- [Woman on street] I'm a fan.

00:14:36.214 --> 00:14:37.329
- Oh you are?
- Yeah.

00:14:37.329 --> 00:14:38.350
- Awesome, what's your name?

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:39.675
- I'm Allie.
- Hi, Allie.

00:14:39.675 --> 00:14:40.893
- Nice to meet you.

00:14:40.893 --> 00:14:42.378
Yes I came to see the stars,

00:14:42.378 --> 00:14:44.096
it's my favorite part of the holidays.

00:14:44.096 --> 00:14:45.327
- Yes, it's really cool.

00:14:45.327 --> 00:14:48.865
- What are you saying
about Starbucks cups?

00:14:48.865 --> 00:14:51.155
- I said a couple things,
I said one, it's amazing

00:14:51.155 --> 00:14:53.535
to have a business where
people give a shit about that,

00:14:53.535 --> 00:14:56.356
and two, it's funny to me
that so many of my friends

00:14:56.356 --> 00:14:59.154
that love Apple's simplicity are mad

00:14:59.154 --> 00:15:00.976
about the simplicity of this cup.

00:15:00.976 --> 00:15:02.648
So I just talked about people complaining.

00:15:02.648 --> 00:15:03.855
- And now Dunkin' Donuts has a cup.

00:15:03.855 --> 00:15:05.068
- I saw that, I mentioned that.

00:15:05.068 --> 00:15:06.201
- It's kind of lame looking.

00:15:06.201 --> 00:15:08.359
- Thanks, nice meeting you, take care.

00:15:08.359 --> 00:15:12.824
(upbeat music)

